# Server-only (never NEXT_PUBLIC): set MOORING_RESOLVER_ALLOW_LOCAL=1 in local dev / e2e so /api/resolve-merchant may resolve http:// and loopback sellers (examples/merchant-server). Never set it on Vercel.
# Server-only: MOORING_DIRECTORY_BAZAAR=1 also scans the CDP x402 Bazaar (~40 requests of ~3 MB per hourly refresh) for Stellar mainnet sellers. Off by default until the indexer worker takes the scan over.
# Server-only: DATABASE_URL (Neon Postgres via the Vercel Marketplace) turns the indexer on — card discovery, the activity feed and merchant-name sync (docs/indexer.md). Absent → the app uses the on-chain salt probe and local storage.
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://…
# Server-only: CRON_SECRET is set by Vercel for the daily /api/indexer/tick cron; MOORING_INDEXER_DISABLED=1 is the kill switch.
